red_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Hz0p2RasO5tjll-AdjpJqw","review_id":"YvU-BiTXFG5fMkfNYm2QEg","date":"2016-01-08T01:17:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9208921790122986,"text_excerpt":"This is a great neighborhood bar in the Warehouse District. It's nothing fancy, and perhaps that's on purpose as this place is really laidback with chill people. We came here to watch football, and all of the TVs were turned on, playing the game while the bar was filled with locals. We ordered Long Island Ice Teas here, which were strong and good. Unfortunately, they stop cooking at 5PM, but I've been told by the locals that the po boys are really good here."},{"business_id":"Hz0p2RasO5tjll-AdjpJqw","review_id":"aQ68PFG-fxBGaWx93xRV0Q","date":"2015-11-01T21:53:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9182153344154358,"text_excerpt":"this is some great stuff right here, that makes this city awesome .... we had poboys and muffalottas, onion rings cheezy fries and okra. huge portions, and great food. lovely place. Romy is one of my fave bartenders up in here. we came in the night before to dress for anne rice ball, and very accomodating. then came back the next day to eat. thank you everyone for being so easy to work with and helping us to make for a great evening. cheers."},{"business_id":"Hz0p2RasO5tjll-AdjpJqw","review_id":"AQGUDUefWvsbGGHHYwig-w","date":"2013-06-06T16:08:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9163715243339539,"text_excerpt":"Our hotel was right next door. We read the reviews and decided to give it a try. Seriously....do yourself a favor, like Amy K said...\"walk straight to the back and order\"...the food here is great! The special of the day was a chicken fried steak, corn and mashed potatoes with brown gravy. It was very good. My husband tried his 3rd shrimp po boy here and it was one of his favorites! The shrimp were very good and falling out of the sandwich there were so many! The bread was very good, especially compared to the other restaurants we had tried po boys at. You put your order in the back, then walk up to the bar to get your drink. The lady in the back calls your number, go pick it up, then pay ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Hz0p2RasO5tjll-AdjpJqw","photo_id":"cQH0aCzA1VEpl0hml-H-JQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/cQH0aCzA1VEpl0hml-H-JQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8763159513473511},{"business_id":"Hz0p2RasO5tjll-AdjpJqw","photo_id":"d4DpnJs5C1OlUnhbpYqN2Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/d4DpnJs5C1OlUnhbpYqN2Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8604973554611206},{"business_id":"Hz0p2RasO5tjll-AdjpJqw","photo_id":"Jfjk5v_kealUsrSjt4CEnA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Jfjk5v_kealUsrSjt4CEnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8407533168792725},{"business_id":"Hz0p2RasO5tjll-AdjpJqw","photo_id":"5ACxZAENMMnyQ_LoJe3aXA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5ACxZAENMMnyQ_LoJe3aXA.jpg","visual_representativen